# Build context for .infra/prod/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads this file, next to the Dockerfile).
# Only lib, src, public, prompts, data, testcases, package files and config/credentials.enc
# are copied; everything else stays out, the master key above all.
**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!lib
!src
!public
!prompts
!data
!testcases
!config/credentials.enc
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
